[en.FOCUS_C12_ANALYZING_THE_WHIMSICAL_IDEAS]
Analyzing the Whimsical Ideas

[en.FOCUS_C12_ANALYZING_THE_WHIMSICAL_IDEAS_desc]
With Cheese Sandwich’s assistance, Pinkie Pie’s creative ideas would be analyzed by military experts to determine their applicability in various fields.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_ANALYZING_THE_WHIMSICAL_IDEAS]
分析奇思妙想

[zh.FOCUS_C12_ANALYZING_THE_WHIMSICAL_IDEAS_desc]
在芝士三明治的帮助下，萍琪派的奇思妙想将被军事专家进行分析来确认可以被用于哪些方面。

